  m_Name: Blade20
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Blade (5)
  description: The Blade (5) plays a critical role in the jet engine's turbine section,
    where it extracts energy from the hot gases and converts it into mechanical energy
    to drive the engine's compressor. Its unique shape and size allow it to withstand
    the extreme temperatures and stresses encountered in this section, making it
    a vital component of the engine's overall performance. Interestingly, the Blade
    (5) is often designed with a specialized sealing system to prevent hot gas leaks
    and maintain the engine's efficiency.
